{"sha": "8fe292a28c8c2641a316754f086236bdff9415a406db5ec131d649be3302a4a4", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:series} 章 --- 数列与级数}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:series:1}", "$\\sum\\frac{\\cos n}{n}$：应用阿贝尔判别法，取 $a_n = \\frac1n$，$b_n =", "\\cos n$，其部分和有界（是几何和的实部，", "见\\cref{ex:b2:series:sinn}）：收敛（不绝对收敛，", "由同样的 $\\cos^2$ 技巧）。", "", "$\\sum \\frac{(-1)^n}{\\ln n}$（$n \\geq 2$）：交错级数判别法，", "$\\frac{1}{\\ln n} \\downarrow 0$：收敛；不绝对收敛（$\\ln n", "\\leq n$）。", "", "$\\sum \\frac{(-1)^n}{n^{3/4} + \\cos n}$：展开，", "\\[", "\\frac{(-1)^n}{n^{3/4} + \\cos n}", "= \\frac{(-1)^n}{n^{3/4}}\\cdot", "\\frac{1}{1 + \\frac{\\cos n}{n^{3/4}}}", "= \\frac{(-1)^n}{n^{3/4}}", "- \\frac{(-1)^n\\cos n}{n^{3/2}} + O\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{n^{9/4}}\\Bigr).", "\\]", "第一个级数：交错级数，收敛。第二个：绝对", "收敛（量级 $\\frac{1}{n^{3/2}}$）。第三个：绝对", "收敛。于是原级数收敛。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:series:2}", "$\\sum_{m\\geq0} z^m$ 与自身的柯西乘积（当 $\\abs z < 1$ 时二者均", "绝对收敛）：对角线系数为 $c_k =", "\\sum_{m=0}^{k} 1 = k + 1$，于是", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{(1-z)^2} = \\sum_{k\\geq0} (k+1)z^k .", "\\]", "乘以 $z$ 并换标号，得 $\\sum_{n \\geq 1} n z^n =", "\\frac{z}{(1-z)^2}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:series:3}", "设 $B_n = \\sum_{k \\leq n} b_k \\to B$。取 $a_k = k$，用阿贝尔分部求和：", "\\[", "\\sum_{k=1}^{n} k\\,b_k = n B_n - \\sum_{k=1}^{n-1} B_k", "\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad", "\\frac1n \\sum_{k=1}^{n} k b_k = B_n - \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{k=1}^{n-1}", "B_k .", "\\]", "收敛数列 $(B_k)$ 的切萨罗平均收敛于其极限 $B$", "（参见本科一年级分册），故右端趋于 $B - B = 0$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:series:4}", "若 $\\theta \\in \\pi\\Z$：各项均为零 --- 显然收敛。", "设 $\\theta \\notin \\pi\\Z$。", "", "$\\alpha > 1$：绝对收敛（以 $n^{-\\alpha}$ 为优级数）。", "", "$0 < \\alpha \\leq 1$：可用阿贝尔判别法（取 $a_n = n^{-\\alpha}", "\\downarrow 0$，$\\sin n\\theta$ 的部分和以", "$\\frac{1}{\\abs{\\sin(\\theta/2)}}$ 为界，由几何和得）：收敛。不", "绝对收敛：$\\abs{\\sin n\\theta} \\geq \\sin^2 n\\theta = \\frac{1 -", "\\cos 2n\\theta}{2}$，而 $\\sum \\frac{1 - \\cos 2n\\theta}{2n^\\alpha}$", "发散（$\\sum n^{-\\alpha}$ 发散；$\\sum", "\\frac{\\cos 2n\\theta}{n^\\alpha}$ 由阿贝尔判别法知收敛（当 $2\\theta", "\\notin 2\\pi\\Z$ 时）；例外情形 $2\\theta \\in 2\\pi\\Z$ 即", "$\\theta \\in \\pi\\Z$，已于前面处理）。条件收敛。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:series:5}", "设 $p_1, p_2, \\dots$ 为 $(u_n)$ 中依次出现的非负项，", "$q_1, q_2, \\dots$ 为其中的负项。$\\sum p_k$ 与 $\\sum", "q_k$ 均发散：若其中一个收敛，则另一个", "等于收敛级数 $\\sum u_n$ 减去前者，从而也收敛 --- 于是", "$\\sum \\abs{u_n} = \\sum p_k - \\sum q_k$ 将收敛，与", "假设矛盾。又 $u_n \\to 0$（因 $\\sum u_n$ 收敛）。", "", "贪心重排：依次取正项 $p_1, p_2, \\dots$，直到", "部分和首次超过 $\\ell$（可行，因 $\\sum p_k =", "+\\infty$）；随后取负项，直到部分和首次降至", "$\\ell$ 以下（可行，因 $\\sum q_k = -\\infty$）；无限重复此过程（每", "一阶段均为有限步，且每一项恰用一次：确为真正的", "重排）。每次换向后，部分和与", "$\\ell$ 的距离至多为最后所用的项。由于第 $m$ 次换向时所用项的", "指标 $\\to \\infty$，且 $u_n \\to 0$，", "部分和收敛于 $\\ell$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:series:6}", "可和性：$\\frac{\\abs x^{m+n}}{m!n!}$ 的有限部分和", "以 $\\bigl(\\sum_m", "\\frac{\\abs x^m}{m!}\\bigr)^2 = \\eu^{2\\abs x}$ 为界。按对角线分组", "（见\\cref{thm:b2:series:fubini}）：", "\\[", "(\\eu^{x})^2 = \\sum_{m,n} \\frac{x^{m+n}}{m!\\,n!}", "= \\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty} x^k \\sum_{m+n=k} \\frac{1}{m!\\,n!}", "= \\sum_k \\frac{x^k}{k!}\\sum_{m=0}^{k}\\binom km", "= \\sum_k \\frac{(2x)^k}{k!} = \\eu^{2x} .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:series:7}", "可和性：作为乘积族，以 $\\zeta(2)^2$ 为界", "（见\\cref{thm:b2:series:fubini}中的柯西乘积论证）。映射", "$(q, a, b) \\mapsto (qa, qb)$，由满足 $\\gcd(a, b) = 1$ 的三元组", "到数对 $(m, n)$ 的映射是双射（取 $q = \\gcd(m,n)$）。按此对", "可和族分组（即指标集的一个划分 --- ", "对可和族而言是允许的，依据", "\\cref{thm:b2:series:rearrangement}/\\cref{thm:b2:series:fubini}", "应用于可数个类的划分）：", "\\[", "\\zeta(2)^2 = \\sum_{q} \\sum_{\\gcd(a,b)=1} \\frac{1}{q^4 a^2 b^2}", "= \\zeta(4)\\, S,", "\\qquad\\text{于是}\\qquad", "S = \\frac{\\zeta(2)^2}{\\zeta(4)} .", "\\]", "（取 $\\zeta(2) = \\frac{\\pi^2}{6}$，", "$\\zeta(4) = \\frac{\\pi^4}{90}$，由", "\\cref{ch:b2:fourier}可得 $S = \\frac{5}{2}$。）", "\\end{solution}", ""]}